    {
      "id": "1.64.2",
      "label": "1.64.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "तथोक्ता साप्सरा राम सहस्राक्षेण धीमता |\nव्रीडिता प्रांजलिर्वाक्यं प्रत्युवाच सुरेश्वरम्",
      "iast": "tathā uktā sa apsarā rāma sahasrākṣeṇa dhīmatā |\nvrīḍitā prāñjaliḥ vākyam pratyuvāca sura īśvaram",
      "translation": "\"Oh, Rama, when that celestial wench is spoken thus by the Thousand-eyed Indra, she diffidently said to that chief of gods while adjoining her palms suppliantly.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "raama",
          "iast": "rāma",
          "devanagari": "राम",
          "meaning": "oh, Rama",
