          "iast": "sura īśvaram vākyam pratyuvāca",
          "devanagari": "सुर ईश्वरं वाक्यं प्रत्युवाच",
          "meaning": "to gods', chief, sentence, in reply, said.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.3",
      "label": "1.64.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "अयं सुरपते घोरो विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः |\nक्रोधमुत्स्रक्ष्यते घोरं मयि देव न संशयः\nततो हि मे भयं देव प्रसादं कर्तुमर्हसि |",
      "iast": "ayam sura pate ghoro viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ |\nkrodham utsracyate ghoram mayi deva na saṃśayaḥ\ntato hi me bhayam deva prasādam kartum ar.hhasi |",
      "translation": "\" 'Oh, chief of gods, Indra, that great saint Vishvamitra is a dangerous one and undoubtedly he releases his deadly anger on me. Oh, god, thereby I am fearful of him. Hence, oh, god, it will be apt of you to accord forbearance.' So said Rambha to Indra.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "sura pate",
          "iast": "sura pate",
          "devanagari": "सुर पते",
          "meaning": "oh, gods', chief",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "itrans": "ayam mahaa muniH vishvaamitraH",
          "iast": "ayam mahā muniḥ viśvāmitraḥ",
          "devanagari": "अयं महा मुनिः विश्वामित्रः",
          "meaning": "he, great saint, Vishvamitra is",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": null
