          "anvayaIndex": 7,
          "verseIndex": 13
        },
        {
          "itrans": "deva",
          "iast": "deva",
          "devanagari": "देव",
          "meaning": "oh, god",
          "anvayaIndex": 8,
          "verseIndex": 17
        },
        {
          "itrans": "prasaadam kartum arhasi",
          "iast": "prasādam kartum arhasi",
          "devanagari": "प्रसादं कर्तुं अर्हसि",
          "meaning": "forbearance, to accord, apt of you.",
          "anvayaIndex": 9,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.4",
      "label": "1.64.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "एवमुक्तस्तया राम सभयं भीतया तदा\nतामुवाच सहस्राक्षो वेपमानां कृतांजलिम् |",
      "iast": "evam uktaḥ tayā rāma sa bhayam bhītayā tadā\ntām uvāca sahasrākṣo vepamānām kṛtāñjalim |",
      "translation": "\"Oh, Rama, the Thousand-eyed Indra replied Rambha when she spoke to him in that way while shuddering in fear and making palm fold in supplication.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
