          "anvayaIndex": 10,
          "verseIndex": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.7",
      "label": "1.64.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "त्वं हि रूपं बहुगुणं कृत्वा परमभास्वरम् |\nतमृषिं कौशिकं रंभे भेदयस्व तपस्विनम्",
      "iast": "tvam hi rūpam bahu guṇam kṛtvā parama bhāsvaram |\ntam ṛṣim kauśikam rambhe bhedayasva tapasvinam",
      "translation": "\" 'Indeed on your assuming a highly sparkling semblance, and multi-multiplexing your savoir faire, with bon viveurs and bon vivants, you disengage that ascetical sage Kaushika from his ascesis.' So said Indra to Rambha.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "rambhe",
          "iast": "rambhe",
          "devanagari": "रम्भे",
          "meaning": "oh, Rambha",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 11
        },
        {
          "itrans": "tvam bahu guNam",
          "iast": "tvam bahu guṇam",
          "devanagari": "त्वं बहु गुणं",
          "meaning": "you, multi-, multiplex",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
