    {
      "id": "1.64.9",
      "label": "1.64.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "कोकिलस्य तु शुश्राव वल्गु व्याहरतः स्वनम् |\nसंप्रहृष्टेन मनसा स एनामन्वैक्षत",
      "iast": "kokilasya tu śuśrāva valgu vyāharataḥ svanam |\nsamprahṛṣṭena manasā sa enām anvaikṣata",
      "translation": "\"Vishvamitra has heard melodious trilling tune of songbird, and while his heart is highly gladdening about the ambience, he incidentally saw and stared at Rambha.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "saH",
          "iast": "saḥ",
          "devanagari": "सः",
          "meaning": "he tht Vishvamitra",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
