    {
      "id": "1.64.10",
      "label": "1.64.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथ तस्य च शब्देन गीतेनाप्रतिमेन च |\nदर्शनेन च रंभाया मुनिः संदेहमागतः",
      "iast": "atha tasya ca śabdena gītena apratimena ca |\ndar.hśanena ca rambhāyā muniḥ sandeham āgataḥ",
      "translation": "\"By the exceptional trilling tune of that songbird and by the unexceptional tableau of Rambha the sage is on his qui vive.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
