    {
      "id": "1.64.11",
      "label": "1.64.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "सहस्राक्षस्य तत् कर्म विज्ञाय मुनिपुंगवः |\nरंभां क्रोधसमाविष्टः शशाप कुशिकात्मजः",
      "iast": "sahasrākṣasya tat karma vijñāya munipuṅgavaḥ |\nrambhām krodha samāviṣṭaḥ śaśāpa kuśika ātmajaḥ",
      "translation": "\"On knowing that as an escapade of the Thousand-eyed Indra, Vishvamitra is enwrapped in wrath and he cursed Rambha.",
