          "iast": "krodha samāviṣṭaḥ rambhām śaśāpa",
          "devanagari": "क्रोध समाविष्टः रम्भां शशाप",
          "meaning": "in wrath, enwrapped, Rambha, he cursed.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.12",
      "label": "1.64.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "यन्मां लोभयसे रंभे कामक्रोधजयैषिणम् |\nदश वर्षसहस्राणि शैली स्थास्यसि दुर्भगे",
      "iast": "yat mām lobhayase rambhe kāma krodha jaya eṣiṇam |\ndaśa varṣa sahasrāṇi śailī sthāsyasi dur.hbhage",
      "translation": "\" 'Whereof you tried to entice me who am wishing to win over the wanton and wroth, you unlucky female Rambha, thereof you will become a rocklike statued wastrel.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "dur bhage",
          "iast": "dur bhage",
          "devanagari": "दुर् भगे",
          "meaning": "you un, lucky female",
