          "iast": "tasya mahatā śāpena",
          "devanagari": "तस्य महता शापेन",
          "meaning": "by his, great, curse",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "rambhaa shailii abhavat",
          "iast": "rambhā śailī abhavat",
          "devanagari": "रम्भा शैली अभवत्",
          "meaning": "Rambha, rocklike statue, became",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 3
        },
        {
          "itrans": "maharSeH vacaH shrutvaa",
          "iast": "maharṣeḥ vacaḥ śrutvā",
          "devanagari": "महर्षेः वचः श्रुत्वा",
          "meaning": "of great-saint, words, on hearing",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 7
        },
        {
          "itrans": "kandarpaH",
          "iast": "kandarpaḥ",
          "devanagari": "कन्दर्पः",
          "meaning": "Love-god",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 10
        },
        {
          "itrans": "saH ca",
          "iast": "saḥ ca",
          "devanagari": "सः च",
          "meaning": "he [Indra,] also",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 12
        },
        {
          "itrans": "nir gataH",
          "iast": "nir gataḥ",
          "devanagari": "निर् गतः",
          "meaning": "out, gone [took flight.]",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.16",
      "label": "1.64.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "कोपेन स महातेजास्तपोऽपहरणे कृते |\nइन्द्रियैरजितै राम न लेभे शान्तिमात्मनः",
      "iast": "kopena sa mahātejāḥ tapo apaharaṇe kṛte |\nindriyair ajitai rāma na lebhe śāntim ātmanaḥ",
      "translation": "\"Owing to his angering that great-resplendent Vishvamitra is now divested of his ascetical merit, and he has no peace of mind owing to ungovernable senses.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
