          "iast": "ātmanaḥ śāntim na lebhe",
          "devanagari": "आत्मनः शान्तिं न लेभे",
          "meaning": "for himself, peace, not, attained.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.17",
      "label": "1.64.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "बभूवास्य मनश्चिंता तपोऽपहरणे कृते |\nनैव क्रोधं गमिष्यामि न च वक्ष्ये कथंचन",
      "iast": "babhūva asya manaḥ cintā tapo apaharaṇe kṛte |\nna eva krodham gamiṣyāmi na ca vakśye kathañcana",
      "translation": "\"His conscience became sentimental owing to the divesture of his ascetical merit, and he soliloquised, 'I shall not succumb to wrath in anyway, nor I put my presentiment into words.'",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "tapaH apaharaNe kR^ite",
          "iast": "tapaḥ apaharaṇe kṛte",
          "devanagari": "तपः अपहरणे कृते",
          "meaning": "ascetical [merit,] in divesture of, made [owing to]",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 4
        },
        {
          "itrans": "asya manaH cintaa babhuuva",
          "iast": "asya manaḥ cintā babhūva",
          "devanagari": "अस्य मनः चिन्ता बभूव",
          "meaning": "his, conscience, sentimental, became",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "krodham na eva gamiSyaami",
          "iast": "krodham na eva gamiṣyāmi",
          "devanagari": "क्रोधं न एव गमिष्यामि",
          "meaning": "wrath, not, thus, I go into [a fit of raze]",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 7
        },
        {
          "itrans": "kathamcana",
          "iast": "kathamcana",
          "devanagari": "कथम्चन",
          "meaning": "in anyway",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 14
        },
        {
          "itrans": "na ca vakshye",
          "iast": "na ca vakśye",
          "devanagari": "न च वक्श्ये",
          "meaning": "not, also, talk - put into words.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.64.18",
      "label": "1.64.18",
      "numbers": [
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथवा नोच्छ्वसिष्यामि संवत्सरशतान्यपि |\nअहं हि शोषयिष्यामि आत्मानं विजितेन्द्रियः",
      "iast": "athavā na ucchāsiṣyāmi saṃvatsra śatāni api |\naham hi śoṣayiṣyāmi ātmānam vijitendriyaḥ",
      "translation": "\" 'Otherwise, I do not even respire for a hundred years for the respiratory gestures will also exhibit moods, and I indeed emaciate myself until I become a real conqueror of my own senses.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "athavaa",
          "iast": "athavā",
          "devanagari": "अथवा",
          "meaning": "otherwise",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
